{"v":4,"catch":"您會採取積極的方式還是謹慎的方式？","desc":"《STRATEGY X》是一款由 KONAMI 於 1981 年發行的坦克射擊遊戲。\n在遊戲中，玩家需要左右移動砲火方向來擊退敵人，並在推進過程中補充燃料。\n目標是消滅潛伏在最深處的「IMMORTALIAN」。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-06-19","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ed7a48041ffcae3b6a5f0aa97bdda5417386c932067fe8de7a292b29449d7ed2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1e59c80fb2743dce45848add461424d8a1b7d89e659e601541c7f14b5a34e54b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fede588dcd2d0e54be9be9b3f57119b40b35cac7e3158225b1ed9a9be948b7f6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d742ec46e8ea7243ee616235e325805aaf36689a74ce6f057192523ed4a5b5e4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/48c3af143b278d902cc729ca4bde7c7efef486f347c13d96a160a25a9d3472d0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6f324e8e94e363f77b3eee69d9bd1fff7b65d7a3c886d33fc98f9b98c63384cd.jpg"],"titleId":"0100fa3023564000","dlc":[]}